Licensing of this vendored directory
====================================

This directory contains code from two separate sources under two different
licences. It arrived here without licence files; the notices below were traced
back to the upstream projects and restored.

1. The ST7735 driver
--------------------

Files: ST7735_TFT.c, ST7735_TFT.h, TextFonts.h, hw.c, hw.h

Vendored from https://github.com/bablokb/pico-st7735 by Bernhard Bablok.
That project publishes no licence of its own, but its source headers state:

    "The code is based on work from Gavin Lyons, see
     https://github.com/gavinlyonsrepo/pic_16F18346_projects"

That project is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3.
This driver is therefore treated as GPL-3.0, and it is why the firmware as a
whole is distributed under GPL-3.0. See the LICENSE file at the root of this
repository for the full text.

2. The Adafruit GFX fonts
-------------------------

Files: FreeSans9pt7b.h, FreeSansBold9pt7b.h, FreeMonoOblique12pt7b.h,
       FreeMonoOblique12pt_sub.h

These are fonts from the Adafruit GFX library, in Adafruit's font format.
Upstream ships them without per-file headers; the licence applies at the
project level and is reproduced here in full, as its terms require:

